# tilt_feilong_vtol aux mixer
#
#===========================

# @output AUX1 aileron left
# @output AUX2 aileron right
# @output AUX3 VTail left
# @output AUX4 VTail right

Inputs to the mixer come from channel group 0 (vehicle attitude), channels 0
(roll), 1 (pitch), 2 (yaw) and 3 (thrust) 4 (_tilt_control) 6 (flaperon).

---------------------------------90

CH1
# aileron left

M: 1
S: 1 0  10000  10000      0 -10000  10000

CH2
# aileron right

M: 1
S: 1 0 -10000 -10000      0 -10000  10000

CH3
# VTail left

M: 2
S: 1 1     -10000 -10000      0 -10000  10000
S: 1 2      10000  10000      0 -10000  10000

CH4
# VTail right

M: 2
S: 1 1     -10000 -10000      0 -10000  10000
S: 1 2     -10000 -10000      0 -10000  10000






